</b>This Condition is usually the result of an entity fine tuning the prerequisite Condition as part of an extended action involving the subject and entity acting in concert, for a number of scenes equal to Rank or a living subject\u2019s Resolve, whichever is higher. Using a Control Influence allows an entity to temporarily create the Open Condition as an instant action.<br /> <b>Ending the Condition: </b> The Condition ends if the prerequisite Condition is removed. Exorcism rituals work by removing this Condition, reverting it to the prerequisite. </span><br /> <br /> Side question - <b>Does Materialized being </b><b>vulnerable</b><b> to normal attacks from non-mystical sources, like shooting with firearms to it or attacks by weaponry?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-15-2016, 09:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T04:03:03-08:00","id":830139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/830125-cofd-ephemeral-beings-how-can-they-create-open-condition#post830125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> rulebook goes in to extended description on to how mortal characters can create or delete <i>Open</i> Condition that is needed to <i>Materialize</i>, <i>Fetter</i> or <i>Possess</i> Manifestations ( i.e. being made herself corporal, &quot;hooked&quot; to item or human or classical posses mortal, respectively. )<br /> <br /> The question I have is other - <b>How can Ephemeral themselves impose <i>Open</i> Condition?</b><br /> <br /> Like, for example, I have idea on the ghost that want to kill PCs, by his &quot;bear hands&quot;. <i>Image</i> Manifestation is too weak for this, so I picked <i>Materialize</i> Manifestation for him. <b>Ghost will try to make <i>Open</i> Condition for him with PCs in vicinity to strangle them. What would he need to do? Particularly that he <i>does not</i> have Anchor to one location, being bound to PCs and his son NPC.</b><br /> <br /> Quoting of <i>Open</i> Condition from corebook to ease the discussion:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Open</b></span><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> The Anchor, Resonant, or Infrastructure Condition for the same phenomenon this Condition is tagged to.<br /> <b>Description: </b>The place, object, animal, or person covered by a previous Condition has now been conditioned to accept the entity. It can attempt to Fetter itself to the subject of the Condition, or, if the Condition is on a location, Manifest.<br /> <b>Causing the Condition: </b>This Condition is usually the result of an entity fine tuning the prerequisite Condition as part of an extended action involving the subject and entity acting in concert, for a number of scenes equal to Rank or a living subject\u2019s Resolve, whichever is higher. Using a Control Influence allows an entity to temporarily create the Open Condition as an instant action.<br /> <b>Ending the Condition: </b> The Condition ends if the prerequisite Condition is removed. Exorcism rituals work by removing this Condition, reverting it to the prerequisite. </span><br /> <br /> Side question - <b>Does Materialized being </b><b>vulnerable</b><b> to normal attacks from non-mystical sources, like shooting with firearms to it or attacks by weaponry?</b></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> First point of Influence allows one to Strengthen his connection to create opened condition.<br /> <br /> So for an Anchor of which Influence a ghost has - he uses Strengthen to create opened Condition, and then he uses Materialize to proceed with strangling.<br /> <br /> Side answer - yes, but it only takes bashing damage from firearms/weaponry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T08:25:38-08:00","id":830244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/830125-cofd-ephemeral-beings-how-can-they-create-open-condition?p=830139#post830139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Side answer - yes, but it only takes bashing damage from firearms/weaponry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Clarification: The justification for this is that, no matter how much the Manifested being <i>looks</i> like a person/organic thing, its form is still nothing more than a condensed-ephemera puppet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T09:32:49-08:00","id":830275,"title":"","content":"It says right there under &quot;causing the Condition&quot;. You've just got to use Strengthen on your Anchor (or on a Resonant person/place/thing for spirits, or on a piece of Inferastructure for angels).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-11T03:04:26-07:00","id":1417610,"title":"","content":"Hi, <br /> I have a similar question about the rules:<br /> <br /> \u201eUsing a Control Influence allows an entity to temporarily create the Open Condition as an instant action.\u201c<br /> <br /> But if you look at \u201eControl Influence\u201c it\u2019s supposed to change the \u201eOpen Condition\u201c to \u201eControlled\u201c. And not temporarily to \u201eOpen\u201c.<br /> From what I understand you should need to use \u201eCreate\u201c (Anchor) and \u201eStrengthen\u201c!?? Or did I miss something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-11T14:16:06-07:00","id":1417702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elythia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/830125-cofd-ephemeral-beings-how-can-they-create-open-condition?p=1417610#post1417610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, <br /> I have a similar question about the rules:<br /> <br /> \u201eUsing a Control Influence allows an entity to temporarily create the Open Condition as an instant action.\u201c<br /> <br /> But if you look at \u201eControl Influence\u201c it\u2019s supposed to change the \u201eOpen Condition\u201c to \u201eControlled\u201c. And not temporarily to \u201eOpen\u201c.<br /> From what I understand you should need to use \u201eCreate\u201c (Anchor) and \u201eStrengthen\u201c!?? Or did I miss something?</div> </div> </div> </div>My understanding is that Control allows you to do both as separate effects; you can have instances of the Open Condition without an underlying basic Condition, though most stable naturally-occurring instances of Open will have the specific quality supporting it.<br /> <br /> I talked out the Manifestation system a bit <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1241532-unpacking-manifestation-conditions-redux\">here</a>, if that helps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T10:16:38-07:00","id":1418065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elythia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/830125-cofd-ephemeral-beings-how-can-they-create-open-condition?p=1417610#post1417610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, <br /> I have a similar question about the rules:<br /> <br /> \u201eUsing a Control Influence allows an entity to temporarily create the Open Condition as an instant action.\u201c<br /> <br /> But if you look at \u201eControl Influence\u201c it\u2019s supposed to change the \u201eOpen Condition\u201c to \u201eControlled\u201c. And not temporarily to \u201eOpen\u201c.<br /> From what I understand you should need to use \u201eCreate\u201c (Anchor) and \u201eStrengthen\u201c!?? Or did I miss something?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that the Control part there may be an error that slipped by, as the charts always show Strengthen being used.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}